# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored via the *.local rule) and fill in.
#
# NOTHING IN THE APP READS AN ENV VAR RIGHT NOW. The one that used to live here
# was VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN, for the /archive-mapbox basemap-vendor spike; the spike
# and its dependency were removed once the question was settled, and the verdict
# lives in docs/mapbox-evaluation.md.
#
# The file is kept because the next variable should land in a place that already
# explains the rule: Vite inlines any VITE_-prefixed variable into the client
# bundle, so anything named that way is PUBLIC by construction. A key that must
# stay secret cannot be a VITE_ variable — it needs a server between it and the
# reader.
